    <Tag>TXT_KEY_RFCMP_SCENARIO_1453_AD</Tag>
    <English>1453 AD: After the fall of Constantinople. Every established major civilization is playable. Regional states are represented by RFC civilization slots; America appears on its usual schedule.</English>
